                  <paragraph>loratadine chewable tablets USP, 5 mg<br/>antihistamine</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>non-drowsy**<br/>indoor and outdoor allergies<br/>24-hour relief of:</paragraph>
                  <list listType="unordered" styleCode="disc">
                     <item>sneezing</item>
                     <item>runny nose</item>
                     <item>itchy, watery eyes</item>
                     <item>itchy throat or nose</item>
                  </list>
                  <paragraph>**When taken as directed. See drug facts panel.</paragraph>
